  "description": {
    "en": "MSV Multi Q10 is a high-quality nylon multifilament designed for players seeking maximum power, high arm comfort and strong tension stability. Its complex manufacturing process creates an elastic, forgiving stringbed with easy depth and excellent shock absorption. Racketpedia data supplied by MSV reports 100% power, 90% tension stability, 85% comfort and arm-friendliness, and 80% spin potential. MSV recommends a 5% pre-stretch during stringing.",

    "zh": "MSV Multi Q10 是一款采用高品质尼龙材料制造的多芯球线，核心定位是最大力量、高舒适性以及优秀保磅能力。复杂的制造工艺带来高弹性、宽容且护臂的线床表现，能够轻松提供击球深度并有效吸收震动。MSV 提供的 Racketpedia 数据显示，其力量达到 100%，保磅 90%，舒适/护臂 85%，旋转潜力 80%。官方建议穿线时进行 5% 预拉伸。"
  },

